water,liquid,tabulated,,,,,,,water.mienk,998,0.3,1.1,"n from Daimon-Masumura 4-term Sellmeier folds to only 3 terms with 2e-3 error over 400-700nm (>1e-4 tolerance), so tabulated route used instead per spec; k(500nm)~1e-9, shows weak absorption shoulder near 975nm","Daimon & Masumura 2007, Appl. Opt. 46, 3811 (n, 20C HPLC water) + Hale & Querry 1973, Appl. Opt. 12, 555 (k, 25C); combined in nk_data/water.csv"
